                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I did buy this game at full price knowing, at this time, it's currently at a \"mixed\" review overall.\n\nHowever, I did spent 18 hours on it before calling it quits. Still, there were plenty of moments that I enjoyed. The ultimate problem is your character will be too strong and once I completed all the scenarios, the ending/payoff was as good as an end screen stating 'you did it! well done!'... but it didn't feel rewarding, it was more like 'huh, guess I'm done.'\n\nI didn't have the patience to 'discover' everything, but that particular process was, again, enjoyable until my character got too strong'. \n\n18 hours on a game I've spent 15 dollars on a game that's more than a decade old? I can't be negative about it. In the end, it was worth it.\n\nFollow-up: Back at it again. However, there's no way I'll be going for all the achievements. Yet, it's more fun playing in shorter sessions. How many more hours will I keep going with this?",
